FAQs
Is there such a thing as YouTube SEO? 
Yes. YouTube is a major search engine, and optimising titles, descriptions, captions, chapters, thumbnails and engagement lifts rankings on YouTube and Google.
What are the best ways to improve it? 
Do keyword research, use the keyword in the title and description, add chapters, captions and a thumbnail, hold viewers' attention and stay consistent.
Is 10,000 free views possible?
 No shortcut is guaranteed, but searchable topics, optimisation, Shorts, collaborations and sharing build views over time.
What's the timeline for ranking on Google? 
Days for some, weeks for others, depending on competition, keywords, engagement and optimisation.
Are Shorts visible on Google? Yes, especially for quick how-tos and trending topics.
